### 🛠️ AIKit Commands (run from the AIKit workspace root)
| Role | Command |
|---|---|
| Status, task and gates | `python aikit.py status <project>` |
| Delivery check (clean tree + map) | `python aikit.py check <project> --strict` |
| Repair memory and map, then check | `python aikit.py fix <project>` |
| Resume an interrupted task | `python aikit.py resume <project>` |

